{
  "_comment": [
    "Complete set of Microsoft Entra ID built-in directory role template ids and display names. Source: Microsoft Learn 'Microsoft Entra built-in roles' (permissions-reference). These are public Microsoft global constants, stable across every tenant, and must not be masked or reported as unresolved tenant objects.",
    "Includes the three default roles every tenant carries (User, Guest User, Restricted Guest User). They were missing, so a tenant object carrying one of those names was treated as tenant data: masking rewrote Microsoft's own vocabulary in CISA SCuBA control statements and the leak test then rejected the bundle."
